'''Tokyo Game Show 2026''' is [[VRChat]]'s first exhibit at [[wikipedia:Tokyo Game Show|Tokyo Game Show]], at Makuhari Messe Hall 8, booth 08-N08, from {{Date|2026-09-17}} to {{Date|2026-09-21}}.<ref name="PRTIMES015">[https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000015.000171307.html "VRChat、東京ゲームショウ2026に初出展が決定"] on ''prtimes.jp''; dated July 31, 2026; retrieved September 18, 2026.</ref><ref name="VRChatJPTGSOpen">[https://x.com/VRChat_JP/status/2100405346556875118 Post] on ''x.com''; posted September 17, 2026; retrieved September 18, 2026.</ref>

== Booth ==

The booth has a stage and a corner to try VRChat.<ref name="PRTIMES015" /> Cosplayers are part of the booth, including on 超かぐや姫！ stages. しんたや handled casting.<ref name="PRTIMES017">[https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000017.000171307.html "東京ゲームショウ2026「VRChatブース」の最新情報公開！"] on ''prtimes.jp''; dated September 4, 2026; retrieved September 18, 2026.</ref><ref name="PRTIMES019">[https://prtimes.jp/main/html/rd/p/000000019.000171307.html "東京ゲームショウ2026「VRChatブース」のステージタイムテーブルを公開！"] on ''prtimes.jp''; dated September 14, 2026; retrieved September 18, 2026.</ref>

