The 超かぐや姫！ sessions replay 「私は、わたしの事が好き。」 by HoneyWorks / かぐや (cv. 夏吉ゆうこ) from Sanrio Virtual Festival 2026 at Virtual Sanrio Puroland.<ref name="PRTIMES017" /><ref name="PRTIMES019" /> The Love Live! stages introduce a 沼津市民文化センター world ahead of a VRChat stream of Guilty Kiss Musical Performance 漆黒のWanted Ghost planned for November 2026.<ref name="PRTIMES019" />

== Profile decorations ==

Three free [[Profile Decorations]] are issued as redeem codes from [https://www.discovervr.chat/tgs/ discovervr.chat/tgs]. Codes are emailed, redeemed at {{VRC link|https://vrch.at/redeem|vrch.at/redeem}}, then collected from in-client Notifications.<ref name="TGSLanding" /><ref name="VRChatJPTGSOpen" />

