== Giveaway ==

Booth QR registration also enters a drawing for three T-shirts signed by 甲賀流忍者！ぽんぽこ. Entries close {{Date|2026-09-21}} JST. Winners are emailed by {{Date|2026-09-24}}. The drawing is limited to residents of Japan.<ref name="TGSLanding" />

== History ==

On {{Date|2026-07-31}}, VRChat announced a first Tokyo Game Show exhibit.<ref name="PRTIMES015" /> On {{Date|2026-09-04}}, it named public-day guests including Hatsune Miku YOZORA PROGRAM 2026, 超かぐや姫！, Love Live! Sunshine!!, 甲賀流忍者！ぽんぽこ, トコロバ/105ro8, and Kizuna AI.<ref name="PRTIMES017" /> On {{Date|2026-09-14}}, it published the stage timetable.<ref name="PRTIMES019" /> On {{Date|2026-09-17}}, the Plasma Slash booth QR claim opened.<ref name="VRChatJPTGSOpen" /><ref name="TGSLanding" />

